{
  "about": "Mission Control and App Exposé follow the fingers (docs/adr/0046-interactive-gestures.mdx), at 1 (1280 × 720): Allo's two windows with the shell. Three fingers down a quarter, half and three quarters of the swipe's 300 pixels hold App Exposé that far open, each moved window drawn exactly that share of the way from where it is to its view in the frame after the motion; lifted slowly past halfway it goes on to its places. The swipe back up a quarter closes it as far, the shell told nothing, and lifted short it opens again; swiped all the way it closes, the windows back exactly where they were. Two fifths down, lifted slowly, goes back; a fast short flick goes through. Four fingers up hold Mission Control, its windows the windows themselves (no copies) as far as the fingers, lifted it opens, and four down close it, every window exactly where it was. No application hears anything of it: neither React tree, and each window only its focus going and coming back.",
  "locale": "es_ES.UTF-8",
  "module": "EditingProbe",
  "window": [
    600,
    360
  ],
  "shell": "OxyOSShell",
  "app": {
    "id": "so.oxy.allo",
    "title": "Allo"
  },
  "companion": {
    "module": "PressProbe",
    "window": [
      460,
      300
    ],
    "at": [
      700,
      300
    ],
    "app": "so.oxy.allo"
  },
